---
title: Getting started
description: Create your account, set up your organization and find your way around nullish.
---

nullish is your invoicing, banking and accounting, in one place you can talk to. Here's how to get going in a couple of minutes.

## First steps

{% steps %}

1. **Sign up.** Open nullish, choose **Sign up** and enter your name, email address and a password. Got an email from us? Open the link to confirm your address. Invited by someone? Use the link of the invitation and sign up with the address it was sent to.

2. **Create your organization.** In nullish, your business is an organization. Give it a name and pick its legal form: **LLC** (GmbH, Sàrl), **Corporation** (AG, SA) or **Sole proprietorship**. nullish prepares a chart of accounts that fits it.

3. **Set up VAT.** Subject to VAT? Enter your VAT number and your methods. Not subject, or not sure yet? Choose **Skip**, you can do it later.

4. **Let's go!** You land on the assistant. Ask it anything about your organization.

{% /steps %}

